#: 
msgid "Welcome to RECALBOX for Odroid Go Super!\n"
"This little presentation will show you how to use all the special buttons available all around the screen.\n"
"\n"
"Press any button to start!"
msgstr "歡迎使用 RECALBOX 進行 ODROID-GO Super!\n"
